  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da164fb3431b960d",
      "translationZh": "Harvey 帮助律师事务所和内部法律团队在复杂的法律工作流程中安全地部署 AI，从诉讼到并购。其客户使用 Harvey 将海量信息转化为复杂的法律文档。借助 GPT‑6 Astra，Harvey 能够在起草过程中引入更多上下文，并生成更结构化的输出。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b61778ce3428bd3",
      "translationZh": "“我们可以向模型提供更多上下文，从而生成越来越好的结构化输出。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b171b56a51d74dc0",
      "translationZh": "“—Gabe Pereyra，Harvey 联合创始人兼总裁”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "03ba264c20b862ac",
      "translationZh": "获取格式更佳的更完整文档",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b40a4c3fb6c8843",
      "translationZh": "Harvey 使用 GPT‑6 Astra 帮助律师从塑造案件的信息中进行分析、综合和起草，包括法院信息、律师事务所文档、案例法研究以及其他法律背景信息来源。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6384cdec5277ff7",
      "translationZh": "与其他模型相比，Harvey 在使用 GPT‑6 Astra 后在文档格式和上下文感知方面实现了显著改进，帮助客户获得更完整的文档，这些文档能够更好地反映其背后的材料。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "55eded510b7c9ccb",
      "translationZh": "将律师偏好带入起草过程",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "adc4adc12311217a",
      "translationZh": "Harvey 的记忆面板将个人偏好直接带入起草工作流程。律师可以编码偏好，例如使用编号列表、将 EDGAR 优先作为来源，或根据优先级对问题进行颜色编码。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fde3cf501ad0ab39",
      "translationZh": "这些偏好与源材料和草案备忘录一起出现，使律师能够更清晰地引导输出。由于 GPT‑6 Astra 能够处理更多上下文，Harvey 可以生成更高质量的法律文件，而客户则可以将更多时间用于策略。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
